---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { mission, purposePillars } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title='The Brand | OTA World'
  description='OTA is Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic. OTA World, LLC is America’s No. 1 choice for massage chairs. Founded in Carrollton, Texas in 2005.'
  bodyPage='about'
>
<main id="main">
    <section class="chapter-hero">
      <img src="/assets/images/home-grid-6.jpg" alt="OTA World storefront at night" />
      <div class="chapter-hero-veil"></div>
      <div class="container chapter-hero-copy">
        <div class="kicker">America’s No. 1</div>
        <h1>The leading house<br />in America.</h1>
        <p class="lede">OTA is Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic. Founded in Carrollton in 2005. No. 1 choice for massage chairs in the United States.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="dossier">
      <article>
        <div class="kicker">Standing</div>
        <b>No. 1 in the U.S.</b>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="kicker">Founded</div>
        <b>2005</b>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="kicker">Headquarters</div>
        <b>Carrollton, TX</b>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="kicker">U.S. share</div>
        <b>35%</b>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="proof">
      <span><b>No. 1</b> in the U.S.</span>
      <span><b>35%</b> U.S. share</span>
      <span><b>$3B</b> market by 2026</span>
      <span><b>2005</b> Carrollton</span>
    </div>

    <section class="mission-statement mission-statement--about" data-reveal aria-labelledby="about-mission">
      <p class="mission-statement-kicker">{mission.kicker}</p>
      <h2 id="about-mission" class="mission-statement-lines">
        {mission.lines.map((line) => (
          <span>{line}</span>
        ))}
      </h2>
      <p class="mission-statement-note"><sup>*</sup>{mission.footnote}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="purpose-deck" aria-labelledby="purpose-heading">
      <div class="container purpose-deck-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="kicker">What we stand for</div>
        <h2 id="purpose-heading">Only a chair you have sat in<br />is good enough.</h2>
        <p class="intro">Inspired by houses that publish their purpose plainly — the work of OTA World in four doors anyone can walk through.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="purpose-grid">
        {purposePillars.map((pillar, i) => (
          <article data-reveal style={i ? `--delay:${i * 0.08}s` : undefined}>
            <h3>{pillar.title}</h3>
            <p>{pillar.text}</p>
            <a class="purpose-link" href={pillar.href}>{pillar.cta}<i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">The name</div>
          <h2>OTA is the three names,<br />written as one.</h2>
          <p class="intro">Osaki. Titan. AmaMedic. The letters are the house — not a slogan beside the brands, but the brands themselves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="letters">
        <article>
          <b>O</b>
          <h3>Osaki</h3>
          <p>Innovation as a standard. A spa that lives at home.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <b>T</b>
          <h3>Titan</h3>
          <p>Power without apology. Built for the body that sits in it.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <b>A</b>
          <h3>AmaMedic</h3>
          <p>Recovery, quietly. Therapeutic comfort without the appointment.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">Origin</div>
          <h2>Founded in Carrollton, 2005.</h2>
          <p class="intro">OTA World began as an importer that refused to sell a chair the guest had not sat in. Twenty years later it is America’s No. 1 house of massage chairs — still shown in person, still stood behind from Carrollton.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey">
          <article>
            <b>2005</b>
            <p>The house opens in Carrollton. The showroom is not a side room. It is the business.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>OTA</b>
            <p>Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic — the three names written as one house, not three catalogs.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>The floor</b>
            <p>Franchise showrooms and major retail — including Costco — put the chairs where people can sit.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>Today</b>
            <p>America’s No. 1 choice. A reported 35% U.S. share, in a market moving toward $3 billion.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="essay">
      <p>We are a Texas company that imports Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic, shows them in a room, and remains after the chair leaves the floor.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container" style="padding-top:72px">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">What we do</div>
          <h2>One address. The rest of the company.</h2>
          <p class="intro">Carrollton is headquarters, showroom, stock, and service under one roof. A guest sits here. A partner floor is trained from here. A chair at home is still stood behind from here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="glance">
        <article>
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h3>Import</h3>
          <p>Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic come to North America through this house — one company, three names.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h3>Show</h3>
          <p>The chair is decided in person. The flagship, partner galleries, and major retail including Costco.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h3>Stock</h3>
          <p>Inventory lives with headquarters. A partner shows the chair. They do not carry a second warehouse.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="num">04</div>
          <h3>Stand behind</h3>
          <p>Training, delivery, installation, and warranty stay in Carrollton — after the truck, and for the years after.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container hq">
        <img src="/assets/images/home-grid-1.jpg" alt="OTA World headquarters in Carrollton" />
        <div class="hq-card">
          <div class="kicker" style="color:var(--gold-light)">Headquarters</div>
          <h2>The Carrollton house</h2>
          <p>1001 W. Crosby Ln.<br />Carrollton, TX 75006</p>
          <p>Not a catalog wall. A working flagship — sit, stock, and service since 2005.</p>
          <dl class="hours">
            <div>
              <dt>Monday – Friday</dt>
              <dd>9:30 a.m. – 6:30 p.m.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Saturday</dt>
              <dd>10:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Sunday</dt>
              <dd>Closed</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/dealers">Visit the flagship</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=1001+W+Crosby+Ln+Carrollton+TX+75006" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Directions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-warm">
      <div class="container quote-block">
        <div class="quote-photo">
          <img src="/assets/images/home4.jpeg" alt="OTA World flagship showroom" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">The work</div>
          <blockquote>
            <span>The showroom is not a side room. It is the business.</span>
            <footer>Sit first. Then the house follows you home — delivery, installation, and warranty from Carrollton.</footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container" style="padding-top:72px">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">Who this house is for</div>
          <h2>Three people. One company.</h2>
          <p class="intro">OTA World is built so each can do their part — and none has to carry the rest of the company alone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="intents">
        <a href="/dealers">
          <div class="kicker">For the home</div>
          <h3>The guest</h3>
          <p>Sit with Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic before you buy. Low pressure. Time on the floor.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/care">
          <div class="kicker">After the truck</div>
          <h3>The owner of a chair</h3>
          <p>Delivery and installation into the room. If service is needed, you call the same house that showed it.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/franchise">
          <div class="kicker">For the floor</div>
          <h3>The owner of a showroom</h3>
          <p>No franchise fee. No royalty. You show the chair. Training, trucks, and warranty stay with Carrollton.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars">
      <article>
        <div class="num">I</div>
        <h3>Received</h3>
        <p>A guest is treated as if they have walked into our house — not a warehouse aisle.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="num">II</div>
        <h3>Seated</h3>
        <p>The body decides. The brands are shown in person, without hurry.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="num">III</div>
        <h3>Kept</h3>
        <p>After the chair goes home, delivery, installation, and warranty stay with Carrollton.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="way">
      <div class="kicker">Philosophy</div>
      <h2>The Showroom Standard</h2>
      <p>Guests should trust the company, not only the chair. Owners should sell, without carrying inventory and service alone.</p>
      <div class="way-words">
        <span>Shown first.</span>
        <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Served fully.</span>
        <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Stood behind.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="care">
      <div class="kicker">After the floor</div>
      <h2>The house does not leave with the truck.</h2>
      <p>Training, delivery, installation, and warranty. A chair of this house is kept — not set aside when the next catalog arrives.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:32px">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/care">Care &amp; service</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
